5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry the ground might shift. Can we trust the local firms to finish on time?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Pretty facades rot fast. I need to know what the city pays annually to keep this alive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I am curious about the volunteer groups. Do they help maintain the green spaces we love?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Who actually walks these paths every day? I need to know the staffing reality behind the plan.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Paper plans ignore rain. I need to see how the drainage and foot traffic actually behave.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if the budget is tight, delays cost more. I want to check the soil history.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, delays are cheap compared to a broken fountain. I will look at the upkeep ledger.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the volunteer groups and the earlier works. Experience matters more than promises.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will check the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I need to see who is actually there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the drainage callouts and the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the earth-moving firms are honest. I will check their tenders and the earlier works.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check the regional habitat fund. Maybe there is money hidden in the fine print.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are looking at the past. It tells the truth better than any brochure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am anxious. If the rota is too short, the park dies. I will verify the bought-in services.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed. The ground does not care about our feelings. It only cares about water and weight.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,Let us see what the ground really says. I am ready to look into the soil and the firms.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I am ready to count the coins. Let us see if this park can survive its own beauty.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will smile and wait for the truth. The past is a kind teacher, even when it is stern.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will keep my eyes open. I need to know if we have the hands to hold this place.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I will check the water and the people. If the design fights the site, it loses.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
