35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The clay is tricky. The firms say small plants are safer. We must avoid deep cuts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, the ledger says greenery costs three times more to keep. The fund only pays for plants, not paths.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The volunteers are wonderful, but the old basin is still strong. The apron, however, is tired.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the roll is tiny. We have seven staff. If we add complex features, who fixes them?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The water backs up when it rains. The people walk straight across the middle. The design must match that.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,I am relieved the basin is fine. But the apron needs care. We should keep the earthwork simple.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if the fund covers plants, we must minimize hard surfaces. Every path is a future debt.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with @May. The volunteers can tend the plants, but they cannot fix concrete. Let us trust the green.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am worried. The casual pool is small. If we choose a plan needing daily attention, it will fail.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The heat is brutal in the open. The people avoid the edges. We need shade and a clear, durable route.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, if the route is simple, the local firms can handle it. I prefer the plan with less digging.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, less digging means less money. The habitat fund is a lifeline, but only for the green parts.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am pleased. The volunteers are ready to help with the planting. It feels right to let the land breathe.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I see the risk. If the plan relies on the casual pool for heavy work, we are in trouble.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The data is clear. The site wants a simple, shaded, and well-drained path. Anything else is a gamble.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I feel safer now. The ground is stable if we are gentle. I will support the realistic plan.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,I am satisfied. The numbers finally make sense. We must choose the plan that costs the least to keep.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am at peace. The past has spoken. The green spaces have endured. Let us follow their lead.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am still cautious, but I see a path. We must match the plan to the people we actually have.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The evidence points one way. The site dictates the design. We should not fight the water or the walkers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
